<body>
<h1>E-Commerce Sales Performance Analytics</h1>
<p style="font-size: 14pt; color: #64748b; margin-top: -6px;">Capstone Project Report — Microsoft Power BI Business Intelligence Solution</p>
<div class="meta-box">
    <strong>Course & Institute:</strong> Anudip Foundation — Data Analytics & BI Program<br>
    <strong>Project Title:</strong> End-to-End E-Commerce & Retail Sales Performance Dashboard<br>
    <strong>Primary Tool:</strong> Microsoft Power BI Desktop (Power Query, DAX, Star Schema)<br>
    <strong>Dataset Size:</strong> 6,000 Transactional Records (2022 to 2024)<br>
    <strong>Author:</strong> Harish Mallipeddi — Data Analytics Trainee
</div>
<h2>1. Executive Summary</h2>
<p>This project establishes a comprehensive business intelligence solution designed for executive leadership, regional managers, and marketing strategists in the retail e-commerce domain. By consolidating 6,000 multi-year sales records across 29 Tier-1 and Tier-2 Indian cities, the interactive Power BI dashboard provides immediate visibility into top-line revenue, profit margins, geographic performance, customer purchasing trends, and logistics fulfillment turnaround times.</p>
<h2>2. Business Problem Statement</h2>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Disparate Transaction Logs:</strong> Large volume of raw CSV records prevented quick performance tracking.</li>
    <li><strong>Uncontrolled Margin Erosion:</strong> Heavy promotional discounts in furniture categories led to hidden negative profits.</li>
    <li><strong>Lack of Customer Segmentation:</strong> Inability to isolate behaviors between Consumer, Corporate, and Home Office clients.</li>
    <li><strong>Geographic Blindspots:</strong> Inability to visualize state-level revenue distribution against shipping turnaround SLAs.</li>
</ul>
<h2>3. Key Business Insights & Strategic Recommendations</h2>
<div class="callout">
    <strong>Insight 1: Massive Q4 Festive Spike</strong><br>
    Monthly revenue exhibits a consistent 35% surge between October and December across all 3 years due to Diwali and holiday festive buying. 
    <em>Action:</em> Procurement teams must pre-order stock 6 weeks in advance to mitigate stockouts.
</div>
<div class="warning-box">
    <strong>Insight 2: Furniture Discount Margin Trap</strong><br>
    While Technology generated strong margins (22%), Furniture items (Tables, Bookcases) sustained losses when discounts exceeded 25%.
    <em>Action:</em> Implement a 20% discount ceiling on furniture lines.
</div>
<div class="callout">
    <strong>Insight 3: UPI Dominance in E-Commerce</strong><br>
    Over 40% of all customer orders were settled via UPI / Digital Wallets, followed by Credit Cards at 28%.
    <em>Action:</em> Optimize checkout flows for mobile UPI payments and offer 1-click UPI checkout.
</div>
<div class="callout">
    <strong>Insight 4: Regional Concentration</strong><br>
    West and South regions (Maharashtra, Karnataka, Tamil Nadu, Telangana) generate ~65% of all national revenue.
    <em>Action:</em> Establish primary fulfillment distribution hubs in Mumbai and Bengaluru to reduce shipping times below 3 days.
</div>
</body>
</html>
